Some people barely have the teeth over the lip. 

99
00:08:55.500 --> 00:08:59.400
If you're feeling keen,
you could ask the people in your life 

100
00:08:59.400 --> 00:09:05.700
to say the list of 10 sentences silently
so that you can get practice with other people. 

101
00:09:07.320 --> 00:09:11.880
Have them say one of the sentences
randomly (not in order) 

102
00:09:11.880 --> 00:09:16.620
