because you already know the sentences. 

103
00:09:16.620 --> 00:09:23.220
The advantage of group classes for lipreading
is that you get practice with different people. 

104
00:09:24.240 --> 00:09:29.520
We each have our own way of speaking.
I placed a link to my online  

105
00:09:29.520 --> 00:09:34.020
